WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.304 --> 00:00:03.012
Ronaldo has retired from international football...

2
00:00:03.731 --> 00:00:06.229
But some men are still playing in three different leagues.

3
00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:08.470
In the relationship transfer market,

4
00:00:08.628 --> 00:00:10.458
some players don't scout one club.

5
00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:12.292
They send DMs to five,

6
00:00:12.439 --> 00:00:15.376
negotiate with three, and sign nowhere exclusively.

7
00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:16.934
First comes scouting.

8
00:00:17.139 --> 00:00:18.372
That's the talking stage.

9
00:00:18.566 --> 00:00:19.932
Then the signing ceremony.

10
00:00:20.126 --> 00:00:22.852
Suddenly, you're officially his number one striker.

11
00:00:24.069 --> 00:00:25.312
Then comes pre-season.

12
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.629
Training sessions.

13
00:00:26.871 --> 00:00:27.812
Friendly matches.

14
00:00:28.009 --> 00:00:28.950
Chemistry building.

15
00:00:29.147 --> 00:00:32.633
Everybody is suddenly playing like they're chasing the Ballon d'Or.

16
00:00:33.301 --> 00:00:35.128
But after the first major trophy?

17
00:00:35.328 --> 00:00:37.301
Some managers lose interest.

18
00:00:37.524 --> 00:00:39.250
The player starts getting fewer minutes.

19
00:00:39.461 --> 00:00:41.536
Suddenly, there are transfer rumors.

20
00:00:44.438 --> 00:00:45.563
Then comes the breakup.

21
00:00:45.753 --> 00:00:49.664
Official statement: we have mutually agreed to terminate the contract.

22
00:00:49.865 --> 00:00:53.677
But somehow, the player is still on loan and available for friendly matches.

23
00:00:55.238 --> 00:00:57.807
And just when you think the transfer window is closed...

24
00:00:57.927 --> 00:01:00.144
the former club sends a late-night offer.

25
00:01:00.327 --> 00:01:00.985
Can we talk?

26
00:01:01.157 --> 00:01:03.529
The player is suddenly back in negotiations.

27
00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:09.426
At this point, forget the Premier League, forget Champions League...

28
00:01:09.795 --> 00:01:12.703
this is clearly a situationship with football terminology.

29
00:01:14.502 --> 00:01:15.733
And somehow...

30
00:01:16.147 --> 00:01:18.004
this is not a football conversation.
